course: dictionary
lesson: 4554
title: Heavenly: three meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Heavenly has three main meanings, and the words around it tell you which one fits. Read the clues before you choose. «Heavenly Father» is about God, so the clue is church.
explain: «Heavenly bodies» are the Sun, the Moon, planets and stars. The clue is bodies, which means objects, and the sky and space are the subject. So heavenly means belonging to the sky.
explain: In everyday talk, heavenly means wonderful. «This chocolate cake is heavenly!» Nobody means angels here. The speaker is enjoying the cake. Try your meaning in the sentence: does "This chocolate cake is wonderful and very pleasant" still make sense? Then it is right.
fact: Heavenly means belonging to heaven or to God, as in «heavenly Father».
fact: Heavenly can also mean about the sky and space, as in «heavenly bodies» for the Sun, Moon, planets and stars.
fact: Informal use: heavenly means wonderful and very pleasant, as in «This chocolate cake is heavenly!»
fact: The «Heavenly Hundred» is the name for about a hundred protesters who were killed on the Maidan in Ukraine in February 2014. They are remembered with honour.
fact: The words around heavenly, such as Father, bodies or cake, are your best clue to its meaning.
exercise: In a science lesson, «heavenly bodies» means what? | Birds that fly very high | *Objects in space, such as the Sun, Moon, planets and stars | Clouds that look like animals | Pets that live in the sky
exercise: The children sang about the «heavenly Father» in assembly. Which meaning fits? | Wonderful and very pleasant | *Belonging to heaven or to God | Made of glass | About the weather at the seaside
exercise: Ella says, «This pizza is heavenly!» What does she mean? | *It is wonderful and very pleasant | It is from a church kitchen | A pizza from the sky | It is cold and hard
test: Toad shouts, «that heavenly vision ... that swan, that sunbeam!» What does heavenly suggest? | Small and quiet | Dark and frightening | Holy and about heaven | *Wonderful and very pleasant
test: Which sentence uses heavenly to mean wonderful and very pleasant? | *The fresh bread and jam was heavenly | Stars and planets are heavenly bodies | Heavenly Father, hear our prayer | The heavenly host of angels sang
exam: What does heavenly suggest in «the Heavenly Hundred»? | *Honoured, as if close to holy or sacred | Covered in snow | Very tasty | Loud and noisy
